"北美渠道销售经理（具身智能消费级产品）(J10427)","OrgId":891354,"Org":"营销中心","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["广东省·深圳市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"使命\n拿下北美核心市场（US/CA）的消费级收入增长：直销（DTC/Amazon）与分销（主分销/国家代理/优选VAR）双轮驱动，跑通样机布点、零售试点与创作者联动，沉淀可复制的增长模型。\n\n核心职责\n\n1.区域营收与管线：负责月/季配额；管理线索→商机→PoC→成交的全链路预测与节奏。\n2.渠道拓展与签约：招募主分销、州/城市代理、专业零售试点店；签订价盘与 MAP。\n3.样机与门店试点：推动样机激活、店内演示台与人员培训；确保30–60天内形成首批 sell-out。\n4.DTC/Amazon 协同：与电商团队对齐价格与活动；主导区域级站外导流（创作者/媒体日/校园社群）。\n5.活动与口碑：联动线下活动经理，落地本地展会/路演；组织媒体/创作者体验，拿到权威评测与门店口碑。\n6.一线洞察：反馈竞品与用户需求，更新渠道战卡/FAQ/套装建议。","Require":"任职要求\n\n3–6 年北美消费电子/硬件/机器人本地销售或渠道经验；擅长 BD 开拓与签约推进。\n有相机/电子/创客渠道或 Amazon 卖家合作经验优先；理解 MAP、返利、门店陈列与培训。\n英语流利（母语级）；能高频出差（25–40%）。\n结果导向：能拿配额、会预测、敢复盘","ClassificationOne":"销售类","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"本科","YearsOfWorking":"5年","WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2025-11-02T11:42:31","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"162448a4-c9c2-4d25-a53f-c111cc8d059f","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":151095884,"PostDateInt":1762053188000,"PostDate":"2025-11-02T11:13:08","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"线下活动经理(J10425)","OrgId":891354,"Org":"营销中心","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["广东省·深圳市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"Offline Events Manager（线下活动经理｜国内外展会与巡演）\n\n使命\n把“线上热度”搬到线下，让用户真实体验产品；确保每一场活动安全、准时、在预算内完成，并带来可跟进的商机。\n\n核心职责（Core Responsibilities）\n\n1.年度计划与预算：制定展会/巡演年度排期与预算，提早锁定场地、物料与合作方。\n2.项目推进：分解时间表与负责人，盯紧关键节点（签证/运输/布展/彩排/开场/撤场），准备备选方案。\n3.标准化SOP：沉淀可复制的展台流程——动线、话术、演示步骤、安全边界与应急处理。\n4.现场统筹：把销售、市场、售前、客服和外部搭建/物流/媒体拉到同一节奏，确保演示顺畅。\n5.线索与复盘：做好到场登记与留资，48小时完成线索清洗回传CRM，两周完成转化复盘与改进清单。\n6.样机与物料管理：建立出入库与损耗记录，提前备件，保证演示成功率与设备可用率。","Require":"任职要求（Requirements）\n\n1.3-6年线下活动或展会经验，独立负责整场活动的实战经历。\n2.项目管理能力强：会排计划、定分工、控预算、抓进度、做复盘。\n3.沟通协调出色：能把多团队多供应商拧成一股绳，关键时刻敢决策。\n4.细心有现场感，安全意识强，能预判人流、设备、舆情等风险。\n5.英文流利，英文可邮件与现场沟通；小语种优先，能适应出差与不规律节奏。","ClassificationOne":"职能类","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"本科","YearsOfWorking":"5年","WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2025-11-02T11:13:08","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRep